{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night of the oldbrand<strong>\u00a0</strong>is a roguelike horror game, set in a haunted old house. By day, explore its  corridors, scavenge for scarce ammunition, and manage your fragile sanity to prepare for the horrors ahead. By night, engage in  combat in darkness fending off the relentless assault of the cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Permadeath</strong>: Every run is a high-stakes challenge. Death is permanent, resetting your progress in the race to survive until the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</strong>: Experience a seamless cycle where days are for exploration and recovery, while nights unleash brutal battles against mysterious and otherworldly threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense  Combat</strong>: Confront the overhelming odds with limited arsenal.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Management</strong>: Maintain your grip on reality as the house\u2019s horrors erode your mind. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Horror</strong>: Face increasingly aggressive and mysterious entities that grow deadlier with each passing night, pushing your survival skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Survival</strong>: Balance exploration, ammo conservation, and sanity management to endure the terror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Epilepsy Warning</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains flashing lights, patterns, or sudden visual changes that may trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy or other similar conditions. If you or anyone in your household has a history of seizures or epilepsy, please consult a physician before playing.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","bac